WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.620
I don't regret staying at home and being your mom,

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.220
but I regret not getting my degree

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.700
That's why somebody's mom just enrolled in college

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.340
I'm referring to myself

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:48.760
I'll see you around the quad

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.200
Nobody says that, Mom

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.200
Well, bring it back

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.000
I think those dads just checked you out

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.600
He's just looking at my smock,

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.600
it tends to catch the light

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.260
Mom, you're a college girl now,

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.280
and we gotta make some changes

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.400
No, we don't know where that's been

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.700
Oh god, that's a lot of hair

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.300
Mom, let me have it

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.200
No! Oh god, no!

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.500
What are you, 20?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.800
Oh, I'm 21!

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:09.700
Ok

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.160
Whoo!

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.960
I love your mom

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.000
You had sex in a library? Frank!

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.220
No, don't tell Frank!

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:22.200
Where?

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.100
In the stacks!

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.200
In her slacks?

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.000
No, shut up, Frank

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.040
I'm older, I'm wiser

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.100
This? Essentially a Google

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.100
Ask me anything

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.200
Turn off your vaGoogle

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.300
You're scaring me

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:37.600
I think my vaGoogle scared Jack last night

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:38.980
Oh my god

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:40.300
But in a good way

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.000
like when you intentionally go through a haunted house

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.000
Ew!

